<task id="task-4381" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Setting up your fuel card integration</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Learn how to set up your fuel card integration in <keyword conkeyref="varsProductnames/001" product="classic-MyG" class="- topic/keyword "/><keyword conkeyref="varsProductnames/00101" product="next-gen-MyG" class="- topic/keyword "/> to begin accessing fuel transaction data.</shortdesc><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><context class="- topic/section task/context "/><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step product="classic-MyG" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Navigate to <ph conkeyref="varsMyGNavpaths/FuelEnergyFuelTransactions" class="- topic/ph "/> in the main menu.</cmd></step><step conref="../../../../Content_Warehouses/MyGeotab/Next-Gen_MyGeotab/Next-Gen_MyGeotab_Navigation_steps.dita#task-8836/fueltransactionsnav" product="next-gen-MyG" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Fuel card integration</uicontrol> in the top menu.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">+ Add fuel card provider</uicontrol>.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Add your <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Customer ID</uicontrol>.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Select your fuel card provider in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Provider</uicontrol> dropdown menu.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Submit</uicontrol>.</cmd></step></steps><result class="- topic/section task/result ">Allow a few days for the data to populate onto the page. If the data is not populating after this period, check with your provider to ensure the data is being shared with Geotab and confirm your account number.</result></taskbody></task>